{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35877","headline":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 五 · 李咸用","name":"依韵修睦上人山居十首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风春雨一何频，望极空江觉损神。\n莺有来由重入谷，柳无情绪强依人。\n汉庭谒者休言事，鲁国诸生莫问津。\n赖是水乡樗栎贱，满炉红焰且相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}